[{:db/id 17592186179812 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-33e8aa6c-4c64-5e8e-9545-627e5d274905" "question-5075060c-ccd9-5c2a-b9cf-7fef772a9413" "question-57fc5625-05dd-5f27-abb4-eec7352265ec" "question-454db898-ad27-5b01-a881-c6014d95c9d4" "question-211707ed-2e8e-5618-9558-77c348dfc786"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186179458 :question/problem "What is $-2.5 - 4.5?$" :question/worked-solution "To subtract $4.5$ from $-2.5,$ we break up $4.5$ into its whole number part ($4$) and its decimal part ($0.5$) and proceed in two steps.\n\n- First, we subtract the whole number part. We start at $-2.5$ on the number line and move $4$ places to the left, which brings us to $-6.5.$\n\n- Then, we subtract the decimal part. We move the remaining $0.5$ places to the left, leaving us at $-7.$\n\n![](images/53/53e5b15019c3189519b0fb4801e2ead2d9cd954d7da84640bb684215e53aca7a.png)\n\nThis gives $-2.5 - 4.5 = -7.0.$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186179813 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-9b306aed-e016-53c4-85dd-2c8860d1b3ae" "question-878f1e7f-afb5-5706-a035-9ec1ffd67f97" "question-69cc1cb5-56cb-5b6d-8755-10b31e399d86" "question-5dee817e-9057-5c1e-b780-3a4e2fb1b445" "question-750b10c3-54f6-5269-a368-26aaa93477ab"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186179459 :question/problem "What is the value of $4.6-7.7?$" :question/worked-solution "Since $7.7$ is larger than $4.6,$ the answer will be negative.\n\nWe start by solving an easier problem, which is to carry out the subtraction in the reverse order:\n\n$$\n7.7 - 4.6 = 3.1\n$$\n\nHowever, since our answer must be negative, we need to change the sign of the answer above. \n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n4.6-7.7 = -3.1\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186179814 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-3b99a68a-4ea2-5b85-9e2d-5e86821ad66d" "question-676d2dc1-9574-53bd-9bbd-6405bde77c8a" "question-602965dd-4071-51d0-aba0-4c67d033eae1" "question-d6a4a7be-87a0-52d6-bb90-bacbe12a0348" "question-8287af57-7814-55ae-a994-8575fd4fc3ff"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186179460 :question/problem "What is the value of $-1.25-3.3?$" :question/worked-solution "Since $3.3$ is larger than $1.25,$ the answer will be negative.\n\nWe start by solving an easier problem, which is to add their absolute values:\n\n$$\n1.25+3.3 = 4.55\n$$\n\nHowever, since our answer must be negative, we need to change the sign of the answer above. \n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n-1.25-3.3 = -4.55\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "question-33e8aa6c-4c64-5e8e-9545-627e5d274905" :question/id #uuid "33e8aa6c-4c64-5e8e-9545-627e5d274905" :question/math-academy-id "q-42711" :question/problem "$0.5-4.5=$" :question/worked-solution "To subtract $4.5$ from $0.5,$ we break up $4.5$ into its whole number part ($4$) and its decimal part ($0.5$) and proceed in two steps.\n\n- We start at $0.5$ on the number line and move $4$ places to the left, which brings us to $-3.5.$\n\n- Then, we move $0.5$ places to the left, leaving us at $-4.$\n\n![](images/10/10fd02636a2fde424ef1b176b1e204a8b436c4500acc09759f488d7efc5cbefc.png)\n\nThis gives $0.5-4.5=-4.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-4bdb783c-2c0e-590e-9989-46f6bcabe37d"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-4bdb783c-2c0e-590e-9989-46f6bcabe37d" :answer-field/id #uuid "4bdb783c-2c0e-590e-9989-46f6bcabe37d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-f61cdb91-d822-5b3d-8d08-5ee52999dbd8" :answer-field/choices ["answer-231b56d4-5c41-55df-b7ea-519021484098" "answer-f61cdb91-d822-5b3d-8d08-5ee52999dbd8" "answer-6fc08af3-5ca8-596a-857e-ec7bf5835af0" "answer-d354d720-4a90-50f9-8c87-968fec07c1ba" "answer-02fbe7ec-d8a5-55fa-8363-0cd33649c630"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-231b56d4-5c41-55df-b7ea-519021484098" :answer/id #uuid "2